1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,150
Jayson Tatum has one regret about Jaylen Brown.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:08,150
For years, Brown's name kept showing up in trade talks.

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:15,105
Behind the scenes, people close to Tatum say he told the Celtics this team was better with Brown on it.

4
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,963
But publicly, he wasn't as vocal.

5
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:24,274
And reporter Chris Mannix says Tatum told him he regretted that, back in 2024.

6
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:29,482
The same year they won a title together, with Brown as Finals MVP.

7
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:34,070
Then, this July, Boston traded Brown to Philadelphia.

8
00:00:34,150 --> 00:00:36,901
So, should Tatum have spoken up sooner?
